<title>USA: Wilmette, Ill. won by ABN AMRO Chicago Corp.</title>
<headline>Wilmette, Ill. won by ABN AMRO Chicago Corp.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Chicago Corp. said it won $5 million of Wilmette, Ill., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest 5.046 cost of percent.</p>
